This crate contains the `Setters` derive macro and nothing else. It is original
work and derives from no other project.

The root crate's NOTICE records that `alpaca-sdk` began as a port of alpaca-py
and that its test fixtures are extracted from that project's test suite. None of
that applies here — no ported types, no fixtures, no captured payloads — so this
file deliberately does not repeat it.

This is an unofficial, community-maintained crate. It is not affiliated with,
